      "summary_en": "Every spell Rumble casts gives him Heat. When he reaches 50% Heat he reaches Danger Zone, granting all his basic abilities bonus effects. When he reaches 100% Heat, he starts Overheating, gaining bonus Attack Speed and granting his basic attacks bonus damage, but making him unable to cast spells for a few seconds.",
      "summary_zh": "兰博的技能都能使其获得热量。当兰博的热量达到50%时，他会处于危险温度状态，所有基础技能都会获得额外效果。当热量达到100%时，他会进入过热状态，获得额外的攻击速度并让他的普通攻击造成额外伤害，但也会让他在数秒内无法施放技能。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1309286:3985666"
      ]
    },
